---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
const steps=[['Register your interest','Choose work permit or visitor visa support, tell us how to reach you, and share a summary of your plans. Review your answers before sending. You do not need to upload identity documents.'],['Have a personal conversation','Verto reviews your intake and contacts you to discuss your circumstances, clarify your request and explain the service options. Save the private reference and tracking link shown after submission.'],['Agree on scope and fees','Before paid work begins, confirm your representative, written service agreement, exact inclusions, fee, applicable taxes, refund arrangements and separate government costs.'],['Prepare and move forward','Follow the document guidance and next steps agreed for your case. Where online payment is arranged, the secure checkout stays on this website. Immigration authorities make all application decisions.']];
---
<Layout title="How it works"><PageHero eyebrow="OUR APPROACH" title="A big journey. Clearer steps." text="Know what happens next, from your first registration to an agreed plan for application support."/><section class="section container split-content"><ol class="steps">{steps.map(([title,text],i)=><li><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h2 style="font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.7px">{title}</h2><p>{text}</p></div></li>)}</ol><aside class="info-panel"><h3>A few things to keep in mind</h3><p>Online registration is an initial enquiry, not a government application or a guarantee of eligibility.</p><p>Your Verto tracking page shows the progress of your intake. For an official immigration application, use the relevant IRCC account and government instructions.</p><a class="underlink" href="/faq/">Read the FAQs ↗</a></aside></section><CTA/></Layout>
